r","titles":["CEO","Founder"],"is_founder":true,"is_executive":true,"is_partner":false,"is_past":false,"start_date":"2018","end_date":null,"person":{"name":"Karl Gilbert","type":"person","uuid":"b1070f52-489a-417e-9080-e3bdd124619d","image":"storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2026/02/23/4c7ecc565c3eedc033df441c7da1aeb6.jpeg","subtype":null,"dealroom_url":"https://app.dealroom.co/people/karl_gilbert","classifications":["super_founder"]}},{"raw_title":null,"titles":["CSO","Founder"],"is_founder":true,"is_executive":true,"is_partner":false,"is_past":false,"start_date":"2018","end_date":null,"person":{"name":"Richard FultoN","type":"person","uuid":"314f131e-cc2b-4a96-8e82-8d80084b867a","image":"storage.googleapis.com/dealroom-images-production/2025/04/17/3b06a90398ee92f3405c23b8025078ca.png","subtype":null,"dealroom_url":"https://app.dealroom.co/people/richard_fulton_1","classifications":["super_founder"]}}]},"patents":null,"revenue":{"value":57000000,"year":2025},"traffic":{"monthly_visits":1100000,"growth_3m":80},"available":["founders","revenue","traffic"]}', '2026-11-05T15:17:21.139Z', 'Raylo is a tech startup operating in the device leasing market. It offers customers the opportunity to lease the latest devices starting from £7.99 per month, thereby reducing electronic waste. The company operates on a lease model where customers can apply for a new device of their choice at the end of their lease term without an upgrade fee. Alternatively, customers can continue to use their current device and continue paying monthly, or return the device and end their lease.

Raylo serves a broad range of clients, from individuals seeking the latest tech without the upfront cost, to environmentally conscious consumers looking to reduce e-waste. The company makes money through the monthly lease payments from customers. 

The company also places a strong emphasis on sustainability. Instead of discarded devices ending up in landfills, Raylo refurbishes and rehomes them with new customers. This, along with their use of plant-based packaging and electric vehicles, demonstrates their commitment to environmental responsibility.

In terms of customer service, Raylo offers flexibility. The lease begins when the device is shipped and the first payment is due 30 days later. If a customer changes their mind, they can cancel and return the device for free within the first 30 days. At the end of the lease, customers can upgrade for free and return their old device, or simply continue with their current device.

Keywords: Device Leasing, Monthly Payments, Tech Startup, Electronic Waste Reduction, Sustainability, Refurbished Devices, Flexible Lease Terms, Free Upgrade, Environmentally Responsible, Customer Service.', '["editors","human resources","web & portal technology","application development & management","javascript frameworks","intelligence and analytics","customer experience management","machine learning","continuous integration","content management system","supply chain management","marketing automation","web tools and plugins","web analytics","database","testing and qa","it service management","Climate Tech","website builders","Responsible Consumption And Production (#12)","Consumer Electronics","marketing analytics","Venture Capital","B Corp","tag management","generative ai","software as a service","widgets","open source","infrastructure as a service","devops","database management","communication and collaboration","Consumer Electronics","build automation","e-commerce","design","platform as a service","fraud detection and prevention","business intelligence","it infrastructure","Waste Reduction","advertising","security","Late stage","software development","issue trackers","javascript libraries","advanced analytics and data science","customer service","development","appointment scheduling","Recycling","applicant tracking systems","data security","caching","system analytics & monitoring","programming languages","cloud infrastructure computing","frameworks and libraries","performance","live chat","Circular Economy","deployment","cloud hosting","Sustainable Development Goals","page builders","b2c","web hosting","customer data platforms","team collaboration","web and application servers","learning management system","Angel","other advertising software","wikis","communications technology","threat intelligence","data integration","Electronics","it","documentation tools","Subscription","Marketplace & ecommerce","web frameworks","miscellaneous","social networks","payment pr