Iwoca''s business model focuses on leveraging technology to offer quick and efficient lending decisions, often within 24 hours. The company generates revenue through interest on loans and fees associated with its financing products. By using advanced data analytics and machine learning, Iwoca assesses credit risk more accurately and provides tailored financial solutions to its clients.

